== Walkthrough ==

Upon creating a Human or Half Elf Warrior follower of [[Innoruuk]], you will have a tattered note in your inventory. The note reads as follows:

: ''The Dismal Rage has need of your dark skills. Take this note to Brutol Rhaksen, he has a job for you. The Dismal Rage is currently operating out of the basement of an abandoned building in the slums of East Freeport.''

Upon handing him the tattered note:

: Brutol Rhaksen says, 'Welcome to warriors guild of East Freeport. Take this to help you on your journeys.'

<div class='facblock'>
* Your faction standings with [[Dismal Rage]] got better.
* Your faction standings with [[Knights of Truth]] got worse.
* Your faction standings with [[Opal Dark Briar]] got better.
</div>

{{YouGainExperience}}

You also receive the [[Faded Crimson Tunic*]]. Good luck, warrior!

